{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"\"There may be a chance to save the gods in the kvatch hatch. It would not be easy, and I don't know if it should be done.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T22:06:31.638000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738517913752961095","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"“Do you think there is a chance for success? Or that this could potentially be a trap?”","created_at":"2020-07-30T22:10:30.391000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738518915155623937","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"\"I do not know.\" He pricks himself on the needle.","created_at":"2020-07-30T22:16:52.089000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738520516113203211","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"Copper sits next to him, “if there is a chance, and you’d have me. I’d be willing to go with you. But in the end, the decision is yours, and only yours.”","created_at":"2020-07-30T22:18:36.334000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-30T22:22:10.941000Z","id":"738520953348292709","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"He nods. \"It's not as powerful, but we are not that strong either.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T22:22:33.080000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738521946332856361","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"Copper nods, “as strong as I try to be, I know I am not as capable of a warrior as Cato or Baeshra. They are much better than I.” Copper looks to Navar, “maybe if we had things to help in the fight? Perhaps the Knights and the Masons can lend something to the chosen warriors to fight this evil?”","created_at":"2020-07-30T22:28:06.245000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738523343728279593","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"\"Perhaps. Melora has faith.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T22:28:50.585000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738523529703587880","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"Copper shakes his head, “I wouldn’t know. I have to ask for permission to even see her. Which honestly annoys me, but that’s not what’s important right now.”  Copper sighs","created_at":"2020-07-30T22:30:50.160000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738524031237750916","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
