{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"Cato appears from the knights room. \"I am sorry Navar. I cannot. I cannot hurt Arctura more then I already have.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T22:40:57.331000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738526577897242715","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"“Perhaps an announcement should be made to the entire ship, asking if anyone has something they can donate to the battle.”","created_at":"2020-07-30T22:45:09.759000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738527636657143880","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"\"Arctura would likely be there. If you two felt any need to prove to each other, now would be an opportunity.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T22:47:11.400000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738528146856345690","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"\"Please. Don't take them. I know you want us both, but neither of us are in our right minds. They are only willing to do it because of last night. I want to believe there is still love out there for us.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T22:48:52.774000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738528572049719427","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"\"I don't wish to force anyone. I myelf fear attempting.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T22:49:54.168000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738528829554819132","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"\"They may ask to go. Please don't let them.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T22:50:41.711000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738529028964876289","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"Web wanders in to the room, looking around at those assembled.","created_at":"2020-07-30T22:54:17.867000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738529935588589746","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"“Cato, you are one of our best warriors. I truly feel if there would be any chance at beating this thing, your assistance would be integral. But Navar is right, no one will be forced to partake into this endeavor.”","created_at":"2020-07-30T22:55:09.877000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-30T22:55:18.633000Z","id":"738530153734340688","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"\"There is a portal to the hunger, and I understand you intend to go?\" Web asks Navar","created_at":"2020-07-30T22:56:07.119000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738530393824952481","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"\"I am no better then you Copper. I heard what happened during the fight. You tried to save Arctura rather then fight me. No pride in that.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T22:56:15.419000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738530428637675550","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"Copper stands and looks to Cato, “my friend, if in a haze you could defeat me so easily, then I am no match against you. The only thing I did was attempt to get the wounded out of harms way.”","created_at":"2020-07-30T22:58:49.938000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738531076737073213","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"Cato shakes his head sadly. \"It cannot be done.\" You remember another time he said these words to you. As Copper was holding out a potion to him.","created_at":"2020-07-30T23:01:27.020000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738531735586734161","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"Web turns to Copper and Cato. \"This mission is surely suicide. How could we hope to defeat the hunger?\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T23:02:24.140000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738531975165378590","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"\"Hope.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T23:03:04.935000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738532146272141442","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"“Maybe take a feast with us” copper says with a laugh","created_at":"2020-07-30T23:03:10.761000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738532170708156509","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"\"I worry you hope too far.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T23:04:48.685000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738532581431181405","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"\"It has killed gods, how could we hope to face it head on?\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T23:05:04.419000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738532647424229466","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"\"The question is, if it is worth the risk. No matter how slim the chance of success. It is for the individuals to decide, but it is a no from me.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T23:06:55.571000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738533113629638776","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"\"I do not see how there could be any possibility of success here. We cannot afford to lose more friends.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T23:08:48.586000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738533587648774164","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"“If you cannot see the chance of success than you will never reach it.”","created_at":"2020-07-30T23:09:10.938000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738533681399988365","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"\"I have heard that Amara intends to go, and that angers me. After everything we went through last night...\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T23:09:18.420000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738533712781770753","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"\"We do not know anything about the situation inside the portal. By the same token, if you cannot prepare for a fight than you have no hope of winning it.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T23:10:19.982000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738533970991644753","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"“We can still prepare for the fight, it’ll just take more preparation than other fights”","created_at":"2020-07-30T23:16:45.601000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738535588394827799","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"\"How? Tell me truly, how do you plan to prepare for a fight against something that can eat a god?\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T23:18:36.459000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738536053367111751","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"“I have some ideas.”","created_at":"2020-07-30T23:19:20.435000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738536237815693452","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"\"Such as?\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T23:20:17.386000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738536476685500517","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"\"Beat it before it is strong.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T23:22:06.976000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738536936339406938","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"“I will tell them to those going in a safe area. There are ears everywhere”","created_at":"2020-07-30T23:22:16.315000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738536975510011994","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"\"If you cannot trust me to know any portion of your plan, or show any evidence thereof, I have no choice but to stand in your way.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T23:24:32.395000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738537546270638151","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
